{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_34", "source_id": "64144bf20000000011011970", "title": "不到300元搞定油痘肌平价祛痘晚间护肤！", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64144bf20000000011011970", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "time_feedback", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 983, "evidence_unit_count": 29, "original_evidence_unit_count": 29, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 91, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["嗨 我是小分琳 今天又是一期有豆鸡评价晚间护肤肤 我之前有发过两三期的评价护肤视频", "看起来是没有豆豆的 但是我只要不服一松懈 我就会满脸长豆", "里面还有一些直脆成分 来帮我们修护维稳 那这个面膜我最喜欢它的一点", "可以在护肤结束了之后 这个面膜配套的水解海绵去豆凝露 这个非常好用", "特别好洗手 好了 那我们今晚的评价晚间护肤就完成了 希望对你们有帮助 晚安", "所以我觉得其实异豆 是比去豆要重要的多的 因为我们脸上不长豆豆的话", "因为它一直抖抖的效果很好 所以虽然它是一个去豆面膜 但我们有豆鸡不长豆的时候"], "retained_quotes": ["所以我觉得其实异豆 是比去豆要重要的多的 因为我们脸上不长豆豆的话", "因为它一直抖抖的效果很好 所以虽然它是一个去豆面膜 但我们有豆鸡不长豆的时候"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64144bf20000000011011970/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64144bf20000000011011970/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64144bf20000000011011970/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64144bf20000000011011970/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "3730080d731965a966df290ff317fe836621226b340d19866f41c22af0adf9b7", "card_hash": "2360415194695eef77d605b96791e027ffabec9f6139d3fc65149e93210570be", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_34", "source_id": "64146d5c0000000012030eba", "title": "家庭版毛孔深层清洁答疑补充", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64146d5c0000000012030eba", "topic_family": "毛孔与清洁", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1333, "evidence_unit_count": 33, "original_evidence_unit_count": 33, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["爱长闭口的宝子你们一定要试试我的深层清洁大法（图3⃣️），只单纯用酸是无法让皮肤达到很光滑细腻不长闭口的皮肤状态的", "排除本身皮肤mm（皮肤mm不能做哈），就是这款导出液不适合你，那咱们换一款黑头导出液就行～", "不需要跟我完全一样 你只要确定你的后续修护产品修护效果好又不闷痘就可以", "MEDI-PEEL Extra Supe", "progi 医美安 医用冷敷贴 medical cold dressing", "爱长闭口的宝子你们一定要试试我的深层清洁大法（图3⃣️），只单纯用酸是无法让皮肤达到很光滑细腻不长闭口的皮肤状态的", "一个是会有爆痘风险（我亲测之前用了一款普通面膜第二天爆了个巨大的红肿痘）；第二个咱们在家操作，一切还是安泉为主，ym面膜的卫生标准会更高；第三很多面膜敷完深层油脂浮不出来，所以建议跟我用一样的～"], "retained_quotes": ["爱长闭口的宝子你们一定要试试我的深层清洁大法（图3⃣️），只单纯用酸是无法让皮肤达到很光滑细腻不长闭口的皮肤状态的", "一个是会有爆痘风险（我亲测之前用了一款普通面膜第二天爆了个巨大的红肿痘）；第二个咱们在家操作，一切还是安泉为主，ym面膜的卫生标准会更高；第三很多面膜敷完深层油脂浮不出来，所以建议跟我用一样的～"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64146d5c0000000012030eba/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64146d5c0000000012030eba/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64146d5c0000000012030eba/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64146d5c0000000012030eba/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "d7a8aa161cfc7dfbb20d0e814273457cb54998024212956