{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_34", "source_id": "6406c09c000000001300521b", "title": "别问我平时怎么护肤的啦", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6406c09c000000001300521b", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 587, "evidence_unit_count": 16, "original_evidence_unit_count": 16, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["很多姐妹问我关于皮肤好的问题，所以今天来分享一些我的相关经验～", "一般有重要场合前，我一般都会选FILLMED 菲欧曼，它们的肌肤灌注是不破皮没有恢复期的，每次做完后的皮肤特别的白白嫩嫩，看起来水灵灵~就像做了它们家的菲欧曼水光一样~而且很多贵妇、超模、名人都是他家常客", "Cici.Zhou 超爱这步冷冻疗法，冰冰凉凉好舒服", "PERFUSION PERFUSION RE-TIMESERU", "BLANTE TAK ELAIRE CET-SAU MED", "很多姐妹问我关于皮肤好的问题，所以今天来分享一些我的相关经验～", "一般有重要场合前，我一般都会选FILLMED 菲欧曼，它们的肌肤灌注是不破皮没有恢复期的，每次做完后的皮肤特别的白白嫩嫩，看起来水灵灵~就像做了它们家的菲欧曼水光一样~而且很多贵妇、超模、名人都是他家……"], "retained_quotes": ["很多姐妹问我关于皮肤好的问题，所以今天来分享一些我的相关经验～", "一般有重要场合前，我一般都会选FILLMED 菲欧曼，它们的肌肤灌注是不破皮没有恢复期的，每次做完后的皮肤特别的白白嫩嫩，看起来水灵灵~就像做了它们家的菲欧曼水光一样~而且很多贵妇、超模、名人都是他家……"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6406c09c000000001300521b/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6406c09c000000001300521b/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6406c09c000000001300521b/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6406c09c000000001300521b/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "70cb979de763b826e4b792048fafbfb1976d46fb2b0cea16ca6ff1cbf6f5e49a",