{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_34", "source_id": "64059dba000000001203398c", "title": "油痘肌用了不闷痘的春夏防晒分享✨", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64059dba000000001203398c", "topic_family": "防晒", "mechanism_key": "identity_proof", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1437, "evidence_unit_count": 44, "original_evidence_unit_count": 44, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 144, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["嗨 我是小森林 這一期想給油豆雞和油米雞的寶寶們分享一些敷感非常清爽", "塗完了之後是完全不黏膩的 上臉沒有顏色 也不拔乾 SDF30P3的假", "因為很多搖搖樂質地的防曬都會拔乾 但是它不會 SDF50加PA4的加", "可能會不太喜歡 這個隔離的質地 就會更清爽一些 是這種淡淡的膚色", "霧悶痘的春夏防曬 分享給你們 希望對你們有幫助", "我之前說過防曬和面霜是最容易讓我們油豆雞悶痘的兩個品類 所以這兩個品類你們一定不要瞎買", "所以你們可以再斟酌一下 好了 以上這五款 就是我非常喜歡的"], "retained_quotes": ["我之前說過防曬和面霜是最容易讓我們油豆雞悶痘的兩個品類 所以這兩個品類你們一定不要瞎買", "所以你們可以再斟酌一下 好了 以上這五款 就是我非常喜歡的"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64059dba000000001203398c/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64059dba000000001203398c/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64059dba000000001203398c/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_64059dba000000001203398c/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "b6e71b626578c879b4cd100bd85b4fb0ca10bf92155178db5b4c9db45574fb50", "card_hash": "e1b438c5ac01774d880614f20746a57bbd4c7b297986edf8f513458bbc146853", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_34", "source_id": "6400678700000000140276fc", "title": "28岁抗初老我做对了什么", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6400678700000000140276fc", "topic_family": "提亮与肤色", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1268, "evidence_unit_count": 38, "original_evidence_unit_count": 38, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 107, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["宝贝们嗨我是小森林 今天想分享一下我的看出老经验 那什么是出老呢", "我今年呢是28岁感觉自己的状态还是可以的 是有一些实实在在的经验可以分享出来的", "里面的A是用的HPR 它是A纯的衍生物 比传统的A纯呢会更温和", "保养心得 他们总是说啊要有一个 好的心态 心态年轻很重要", "这样才可以从内向外的看老", "功效会太猛出现翻车的情况 那抗出脑的第二点呢 就是咱们一定不要结实减肥", "像我就是他们太猛了 我总会因为A纯而翻车或者用了圆形迷C之后呢"], "retained_quotes": ["功效会太猛出现翻车的情况 那抗出脑的第二点呢 就是咱们一定不要结实减肥", "像我就是他们太猛了 我总会因为A纯而翻车或者用了圆形迷C之后呢"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6400678700000000140276fc/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6400678700000000140276fc/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6400678700000000140276fc/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6400678700000000140276fc/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "24451e41df9a58612c93eea90d8fce2fe992a66f639971aa4c68007f2c76321e", "card_hash": "5438e73333735eb3b8f3fe0faa30a1374cf7b73d5652fa4ad5698aba4ec6e3f9", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
